    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Booga sighadoawanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iihiti ng'eanyiida ghayi goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U jea hearana, ak giimbali, nea giibiidi jeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaygeani haghweega ghayi sean bea madeeda bea madamnyeanda, ilaji aba ng'eanyiidaang'u giyiini jeeda sooscheanda, ak guwi heeda jea gwalooseey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U was heeda jea ghwanung' goobiida gheawungaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang'ata giweesi ashoohoocheanda mida gadiyeeda aba damandida, ak giyeeshi niny, ‘Aniini gearugu eaweecheanji aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU gideaba naawunyi jeedeaba ng'eanyiini ghayi aksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawoodean gideaba gayghoadaw ghweanigaasa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaygageanda ashoohoocheanda sooscheanda mida geatindaang'u, ak gayghwayiin ng'eanyi aba madeeda heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak girukuti geaw aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U nea giyeeshi, ‘Bwaabwa siida ng'eanyiida Arameni gil, ak gaweelweel ea ghwararang'aada gawa ng'eanyiida Misri ak ghoah rabascheanda aba hoowa, nea geewooschi ng'ay, aba hoowa geeyi bwak ea eahuuwa eemeeda saang'a, mideawa uurda, bwada seang'ayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaghabwaseasa fuga Misri, nea gwasawaneasa, nea ghwanung' eesina gadiyeeda hang'waay bea soomjeandumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeawusi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweanigaasa, ak ghwayiiy NG'UTAMIIDA ghuusigaasa, nea ghwadaah sawanadeedeanya ea minighisteanya ea ghabasteanya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gooruunaneasa NG'UTAMIIDA ng'eanyiida Misri aba geatinda mideawa uurda, ea geatinda doabiiwaat ea gharbeeda ng'waan sea gwadeagwajeega ea ng'asheega deamdeameadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gweaneasa hiji ak gagooneasa ng'eanyiini, ng'eanyiida nyiit eanooga ea maleeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'ula, ghamneawa geayeadu haghweega madeeda bea madamnyeanda, igooni, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA.’ Ak giyiini ng'eanyi madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak gibwadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gayhoosana aba gea miyaasiin sean goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ea gheang'u, ea siida Lawi, ea rabascheanda mida jeedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iihiidi giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sean bea ghadooweeda, aba gweaydeaba samwagu, was gweayda siitayda gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush, adawa siida Lawi, ea rabascheanda, ea bananga, ea masiinung'weanda, ak gweagiischi aba mujiinajeagaagu ea gwalang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeena aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ‘Ak ea neageandi haleanjeeda ghaydidi aba jeedeaba gheanyu, ak ea naadawji Lawi, ea rabascheanda, ea bananga, ea masinung'weanda, gawuurji gidanyaashta diigheanyeakaagu ghayi irukunean, ak ea mii dafool diigheanyeakaagu, nea mii gwaroosean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ea miidaak aba jeedeaba haleanjeedida siitaydaan gilagi aba jeeda damanamughuush aba damanda eawooschi shoogoocheanda, ghana dageanda gida wassean nea geabea ririnnyaan, ghana daadayda gida wassean aadawji fuga nimeewa, ak ea nealeeysi iit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU, ak geasindi haleanjeeda sean gida irukuteaydi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'weersiina ng'eanyi aba headaang'u iibiiti ghaydit bea humng'eeda, ak giidawi ghawooda fugaagu was Israeli ea ng'eanyiida igoonyeasa, ghayi iyeaksi habeawooda ghweanigaasa, was ng'eanyiida nyiit eanooga ea maleeda.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eaweecheanji gwarukuneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gideaba ang'waanya digheanyeeka ea deaweedajeega; asi shageada ak gisini sean muuchi aba gurooroadaang'u ea aba jeadaang'u sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecheanji nimwasi aada geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea gineayeewi jeeda naweadingaaschi, nea giing'waanyi deaweedajeagaaschi ea diigheanyeekaaschi ea girgweaguutkaaschi, nea giileeysiit ghuutaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea nirugu NG'UTAMIIDA ak ea ninung' awoosa fugaaschi ahaaghwa ghayi heeleesa, gideaba gajeang'waanya diigheanyeekaaschi sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygoodiing'daneey una uhuuda eemoojiga sean ghayi sin, aba giigheambiita ea gheawunga ea mureeda, ak gayghoah fuga ghaydidi aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, gawuurji gidaghayi nyaashta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
